nder a.g. fronzoni in milan\nand at the architectural association in london.\nhis integrity, clarity of mind, inventiveness and concern for details is\nreflected in his architecture:\naustere but not extreme, contemporary yet timeless,\ncalming but not ascetic, strong but not intimidating,\nelegant but not ostentatious, simple but not soulless.\nwww.claudiosilvestrin.com\n\nINVITATION\nView invitation\n\nPRESS\nIl Giornale dell’Arredamento – Settembre 2012\nAmbiente Cucina – Gruppo Il Sole 24 Ore – Settembre/Ottobre 2012\n\nPRESS RELEASE\nComunicato stampa Ikonos\n\nIN COLLABORATION WITH\nSub-Zero Wolf\nwww.frigo2000.it\n\nI vini dei Feudi di San Gregorio\nwww.feudi.it--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nThe Immateriality of the Material by Claudio Silvestrin | Glasp (https://glasp.co/books/8842220167)\nciteturn33search11 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: last month; \"The Immateriality of the Material\" by Claudio Silvestrin explores the profound interplay between architectural design and the intangible aspects of our existence. ... In this meticulously crafted book, Silvestrin delves into the transformative power of simplicity, emphasizing the importance of minimalism in design.\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nDigitization, Copyright (https://s3-euw1-ap-pe-df-pch-content-store-p.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com/9781003424413/f4aeac74-903b-4591-a657-2e108cfc9eec/preview.pdf?AWSAccessKeyId=ASIAQFVOSJ57WT3QDWAK&Expires=1771199731&Signature=E49tHMqMbvmN6wMLphYb20H6QKs%3D&response-content-disposition=attachment%3B+filename%3D%2210.4324_9781003424413_previewpdf.pdf%22&x-amz-security-token=IQoJb3JpZ2luX2VjEF4aCXVzLWVhc3QtMSJIMEYCIQCpOSUQtr5gi25AMomwWxt59HcTo6xWLaqGZpxi20g1gwIhAIk4BmBYEE%2FuX81ugunK2eEeYKS5LofiaoOOb2%2BkM0STKo0ECCcQBBoMMDEyMTc3MjY0NTExIgwuNJXDbJQsnITP1P4q6gPln6RThBSJDNIPLo%2B1g7BQzqSqZgyMX%2BP%2Bf1%2FmA3vI5MMNJ54AlMYg6WaufQKBg8U3aHa6NA4Y6e21siq4fa1jW7Q3l%2FDGB8ovjdt9qC4Pct2